cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or corpus, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Logograms Analyser: a diachronic corpus and tool for tracking logographic density in cuneiform divination"
abstract: >-
  Logograms Analyser is a Streamlit application and analysis toolkit for
  measuring the Logogram Density Index (LDI) across a hand-built corpus of
  Mesopotamian omen texts, spanning the Old Babylonian, Middle, and
  first-millennium periods and the major divination genres (astrology,
  diagnostic, extispicy, izbu, terrestrial). It accompanies the article on
  the "logographic shift" in cuneiform divination.
type: software
authors:
